{"id":"5c9d283e18d1aa468ec2387f","slug":"anish-kapoor-monochrome-lilac","title":"Monochrome (Lilac)","artists":["Anish Kapoor"],"date":"2015","medium":"Fibreglass and paint","dimensions":"35 2/5 × 35 2/5 × 18 9/10 in","image":"5MEqltbpVMOWo_0Rif_j8g","c":["#e7e8e8","#babbb9","#cacdda"],"said":[{"k":"note","q":"Sensual, poetic, and unsettling, Monochrome (Lilac), 2015, is emblematic of the artist’s body of circular concave structures that investigate the phenomenology of experience. Enticing the viewer into another dimension through an improbable marriage of form and texture, Monochrome (Lilac) liquifies all possible sense of reflection and plunges the eye into boundless depth, playing on the illusion of the sculpture’s sensual curvature.","by":"Phillips, on Artsy"}],"events":[{"k":"made","y":"2015","q":"2015","o":1,"s":[0]},{"k":"offered","y":"2019-03-28","e":"2019-04-11","who":"Phillips","t":"Phillips: New Now (April 2019)","n":"at auction","o":2,"s":[0],"x":[0]},{"k":"listed","y":"2019-03-28","who":"Phillips","n":"listed by the auction house","o":3,"s":[0]},{"k":"owned","who":"Kamel Mennour","v":"Kamel Mennour","q":"Kamel Mennour, Paris","ll":[48.8589,2.32],"w":"Paris, FR","p":"paris-fr","pr":"city","o":1,"s":[1]},{"k":"owned","who":"the present owner","n":"acquired from the above","q":"Acquired from the above by the present owner","o":2,"s":[1]},{"k":"written","who":"Phillips","v":"Phillips","n":"auction catalogue note (\"From the Catalogue\")","q":"Courtesy of Phillips","o":1,"s":[1]}],"sources":[{"name":"Artsy","url":"https://www.artsy.net/artwork/anish-kapoor-monochrome-lilac"},{"name":"Phillips, on Artsy","url":"https://www.artsy.net/artwork/anish-kapoor-monochrome-lilac"}],"threads":[{"id":"e91d52fa","k":"sale","name":"Phillips: New Now (April 2019)","at":"Phillips","y":2019,"n":2},{"id":"61cc9394","k":"artist","name":"Anish Kapoor","y":2013,"n":29}],"asof":"2026-10-01"}